@startuml SequenceDiagram
title Auction System - Sequence Diagram: Bidding Process

actor Bidder as B
participant "Client UI" as ClientUI
participant "WebSocket\nServer" as WebSocketServer
participant "Auction\nManager" as AuctionManager
participant "Auction\nSession" as AuctionSession

== Login Phase ==
B ->> ClientUI: Enter credentials
ClientUI ->> WebSocketServer: Login request
WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Verify credentials\n& Generate JWT
WebSocketServer ->> ClientUI: Return JWT token

== Browse Items Phase ==
B ->> ClientUI: View available items
ClientUI ->> AuctionManager: Get all auction sessions
AuctionManager ->> ClientUI: Return active auctions
ClientUI ->> B: Display items with current price

== Join Auction Room ==
B ->> ClientUI: Click on item to bid
ClientUI ->> WebSocketServer: JOIN action + itemId + JWT
WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Verify JWT token
WebSocketServer ->> AuctionManager: Get auction session
AuctionManager ->> AuctionSession: Get current state
AuctionSession ->> AuctionManager: Return session details
AuctionManager ->> WebSocketServer: Return session
WebSocketServer ->> ClientUI: Show current bids & price

== Placing Bid ==
B ->> ClientUI: Enter bid amount
ClientUI ->> WebSocketServer: BID action + itemId + price + JWT
WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Verify token & validate role
WebSocketServer ->> AuctionManager: Get session for item
AuctionManager ->> AuctionSession: Place bid
AuctionSession ->> AuctionSession: placeBid(username, price)
AuctionSession ->> AuctionManager: Return success/failure

alt Bid Successful
    AuctionManager ->> WebSocketServer: Return true
    WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Build response with\nnew price data
    WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Broadcast to all\nclients in room
    WebSocketServer ->> ClientUI: Broadcast update
    ClientUI ->> B: Show new highest bid
else Bid Failed (Price too low or auction ended)
    AuctionManager ->> WebSocketServer: Return false
    WebSocketServer ->> ClientUI: Send error message
    ClientUI ->> B: Show error
end

== Auction Ends (Auto-triggered after duration) ==
AuctionManager ->> AuctionSession: finishAuction()
AuctionSession ->> AuctionManager: isFinished = true
AuctionManager ->> AuctionManager: Execute callback
AuctionManager ->> WebSocketServer: Call onAuctionEnd callback
WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Build AUCTION_ENDED\nresponse with winner
WebSocketServer ->> WebSocketServer: Broadcast to room
WebSocketServer ->> ClientUI: Announce winner\nand final price
ClientUI ->> B: Display auction results

@enduml

